    <briefdescription>
<para>The only &quot;global&quot; variable in CSMP computations that is used to store simulated (as opposed to computation) time so that it can be accessed across classes and processors. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>P. Lang </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>Aug 2011</para>
</simplesect>
To improve global status of the verbose variable. No explicit instantiation required any more.</para>
<para>Usage:</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="preprocessor">#include<sp/>&quot;ModelTime.h&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">bool&amp;<sp/>model_time(<sp/>ModelTime::Instance().modelTime<sp/>);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
